<entry><title>Virginia Capital Trail, November 20</title><id>https://rvabikefeed.github.io/post/14aaa0fc77752354</id><updated>2026-11-20T01:14:08Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T01:14:08Z</published><author><name>Virginia Capital Trail</name></author><content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;From Virginia Capital Trail&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;🚴‍♀️ Happy Community Thursday! Did you hear the exciting news? Good things are 🚲...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/83c29757394de550.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;🚴‍♀️ Happy Community Thursday! Did you hear the exciting news? Good things are 🚲...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/e7eb56a61b88fc0f.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;🚴‍♀️ Happy Community Thursday! Did you hear the exciting news? Good things are 🚲...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/575abfcea058a36e.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;🚴‍♀️ Happy Community Thursday! Did you hear the exciting news? Good things are 🚲...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/2fa23e246087415f.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;🚴‍♀️ Happy Community Thursday! Did you hear the exciting news? Good things are 🚲...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/e620d965cd6020dd.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;🚴‍♀️ Happy Community Thursday! Did you hear the exciting news? Good things are 🚲...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/3457a7bb31d495f5.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;🚴‍♀️ Happy Community Thursday! Did you hear the exciting news? Good things are 🚲&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
The Commonwealth ranked 10th in the nation and No. 1 among Southern States in the League of American Bicyclists’ 2026 Bicycle Friendly State Report Card! 👏🏾&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Every two years, the League evaluates all 50 states on their efforts to make bicycling better, safer, and more abundant. The report highlights progress in several areas, including infrastructure, funding, laws, and support for bicycling. 🏙🚲&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Virginia met four of the report’s five key actions, with policies supporting Complete Streets, a three-foot passing law, and lower speed limits on certain roads. 🤩 Virginia is also the first state to fully implement a Stop Super Speeders law. &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
It’s great to see this kind of progress happening across the Commonwealth. 🎉 Congratulations and thank you to the many people, communities, and organizations working to make biking safer and more accessible. We’re so glad to be working alongside you! 🙌🏾&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
✨ View the full report: bikeleague.org/bfa/states&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
🏷️ #bikefriendlystates #bikepedinfrastructure #virginia #saferstreets #leagueofamericanbicyclists</content></entry>
