ages/e1cd240453119002.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;🍂 November’s Trail Mix is here, and we’ve got LOTS to celebrate! 🏃‍♀️ From a record-breaking Cap Trail...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/b496069b925fb7da.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;🍂 November’s Trail Mix is here, and we’ve got LOTS to celebrate! 🏃‍♀️ From a record-breaking Cap Trail...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/8d5d56c0bde787b4.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;🍂 November’s Trail Mix is here, and we’ve got LOTS to celebrate! 🏃‍♀️ From a record-breaking Cap Trail Classic to exciting progress on the Extension into Williamsburg, there’s plenty of great news! &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Race day photos are here 📸, we’re counting down to our very first Giving Trailsday (with $10,000 more reasons to join in! 😉), and it’s almost time to get those wheels ready for Cap2Cap 2027! 🚴🏿‍♀️ Registration opens this Friday, November 20! 📅 Plus, we’re kicking off a new Economic Impact Study and need your help sharing what the Trail means to you. 📣 Be sure to check it out! 👨🏿‍💻&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
And that’s not all... we’re spotlighting the runner behind the new Run the River Ultra in this month’s Faces of the Trail 🏃‍♂️, celebrating Virginia’s ranking among the nation’s most bike-friendly states 🚲, and looking forward to an exciting year ahead!&lt;br/&gt;
