<entry><title>Virginia Capital Trail, November 17</title><id>https://rvabikefeed.github.io/post/5861e3ed7855d4fc</id><updated>2026-11-17T23:40:14Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T23:40:14Z</published><author><name>Virginia Capital Trail</name></author><content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;From Virginia Capital Trail&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;📣 Have you used the Virginia Capital Trail this year? We’d love to hear about it!...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/f6b885e47af47756.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;📣 Have you used the Virginia Capital Trail this year? We’d love to hear about it!...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/094e05ac925c00ca.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;📣 Have you used the Virginia Capital Trail this year? We’d love to hear about it!...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/f042abb2660b48f9.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;📣 Have you used the Virginia Capital Trail this year? We’d love to hear about it!...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/7e150d5baa807724.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;📣 Have you used the Virginia Capital Trail this year? We’d love to hear about it!...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/ddb8c4b47633f634.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;📣 Have you used the Virginia Capital Trail this year? We’d love to hear about it!&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Whether you’ve biked 🚴🏻, enjoyed a walk 🚶🏾‍♀️, used the Trail to commute 🏡, traveled here for a visit 💼, or stopped at a local business along the way 🛍️, we want to hear about your experience! &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
We’re teaming up with LaBella Associates, who led the Empire State Trail economic impact study, to take a fresh look at how the Virginia Capital Trail benefits our communities and local businesses. Our last study was completed in 2019, and a lot has changed since then!&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Please take a few minutes to share how you use the Trail and what it means to you, and then share it with your friends! 🗣 Your input will help tell the Trail’s story and support future investment!&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
📝 Take the survey: https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/YP5S8JB or 🔗 in story!&lt;br/&gt;
